  "printed_obligations": {
    "Castle Doom": [
      "Land with ordinary land-play legality and no entry-tapped text.",
      "Tap to add exactly C, unrestricted.",
      "Tap to add exactly one of W/U/B/R/G, with spending permitted only on an artifact SPELL. This excludes every activation, including artifact activations and Castle own third ability; it excludes ward/resolution costs, plot payments and land plays.",
      "Pay3, tap Castle and sacrifice one controlled artifact permanent to activate a nontargeting sorcery-speed ability creating one untapped 3/3 colorless named Doombot artifact creature Robot Villain token. Self sacrifice is legal if Castle is an artifact. Mana production and nonmana costs cannot double-spend the same resource. Source departure after paid activation does not stop the token."
    ],
    "Doctor Doom": [
      "Legendary 3/3 Human Scientist Villain for4BB.",
      "ETB creates two shared exact Doombots for the captured trigger controller; the trigger survives departure/control changes and resolves independently of whether Doom remains.",
      "Live source-only indestructible iff its current controller controls at least one permanent that is both artifact AND creature, OR a permanent with Plan subtype. This includes Doom himself if he is an artifact creature and includes tokens. It is neither a CDA nor a frozen entry condition.",
      "At beginning of its current controller own end step, capture that controller; mandatory draw1 then lose1 life, no targets or optional choice. Source departure/control changes after triggering do not redirect it. Empty draw or life0 loss is checked after the entire resolution."
    ]
  },
