  "shared_mechanics": [
    "Exact artifact-SPELL-only mana quality, independently captured from producer and excluding activation/other purposes; old ExceptNonArtifactSpells behavior unchanged.",
    "Per-object conjunction CountAllKinds adds no fields to existing CountFilter and preserves ordinary Count union semantics.",
    "SourceConditionalKeywords grants through actual and speculative earlier-layer types/control, including noncreature permanent source, using ordered ability evaluation plus ordinary/funding query paths.",
    "One canonical exact Doombot token recipe shared by both cards: actual name Doombot, 3/3, colorless artifact creature Robot Villain; old token recipes unchanged."
  ],
